{"id":"484e951b19c4c192","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map.md","title":"ZFC Top2 Closed Map","display":"df-zfc-top2-closed-map — ZFC Top2 Closed Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map"],"display":"df-zfc-top2-closed-map — ZFC Top2 Closed Map","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-zfc-rel-image.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top2-closed-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top2-closed-map — ZFC Top2 Closed Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c189b9b31702b9de\" href=\"?note=c189b9b31702b9de\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-rel-image.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-rel-image.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,C,B\\in V\">\\(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,C,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span>（函数谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span>（拓扑空间谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S\\)</span>（闭集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" href=\"?note=4dc8b2d2e69010a2\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S\\)</span>（关系像谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c189b9b31702b9de\" href=\"?note=c189b9b31702b9de\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-zfc-rel-image.md\">../batch19/58-df-zfc-rel-image.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>（本原子定义的谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}closed\\text{-}map}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau_X,C)\\to\\exists B\\subseteq Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S(B,f,C)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,B)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top2\\text{-}closed\\text{-}map}\\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop2ClosedMap}_S(f,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall C\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(X,\\tau_X,C)\\to\\exists B\\subseteq Y\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S(B,f,C)\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ClosedSet}_S(Y,\\tau_Y,B)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>闭映射把每个闭集送到闭集。</li>\n<li>闭映射不必连续，因此连续映射谓词不属于本定义的前提。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"74086485fba8d86f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"4dc8b2d2e69010a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-top5-closed-set.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-zfc-rel-image.md","status":"resolved","id":"c189b9b31702b9de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","locatio